- Wait - if the chain HEAD already has certs linked after it, `mbedtls_x509_crt_free(chain)` will FREE THE ENTIRE CHAIN!

BUT: if `chain->version == 0`, it means the chain is empty (no previous certs). So chain->next should be NULL.

